  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\rOnce there was a time where the sun shone brightly o'er the kingdom,
    bringing warmth and life to all who lived within.\r\n\r\nBut one night, an Evil
    Wizard Pirate stole the sun from the sky, plunging the world into eternal darkness.\r\n\r\nWith
    the sun imprisoned aboard the pirate's flying ship, the kingdom's fate now rests
    in the hands of an unlikely hero.\r\n\r\nGuy, a young wizard's apprentice, has
    been tasked with rescuing the stolen sun.\r\n\r\nBut the task will not be easy.
    The skies are filled with danger, and the pirate's loyal Blobmeister army stand
    ready to stop anyone who dares oppose their master.\r\n\r\nArmed with little
    more than his courage and knowledge of magic, Guy must venture into the unknown,
    recover a powerful magic staff, and restore the light.\r\n\r\nAnd so, his adventure
    begins..."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d40c7fcc2d6a714a8abf4a01b275723, type: 2}
